he was trying to get in early.

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:30.150
The entrance exam had a scientific section
which Einstein apparently did quite well

00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:34.950
on as well as a general section which
was his downfall. Apparently he got quite

00:01:34.950 --> 00:01:39.900
low grades in the linguistics questions.
After that disappointment Einstein

00:01:39.900 --> 00:01:45.320
enrolls in the Aargau* School which is a
secondary school near Zurich in

00:01:45.320 --> 00:01:49.400
Switzerland where he will continue his
education and graduating from this

00:01:49.409 --> 00:01:54.810
school would allow him to be directly
admitted to ETH without having to do the

00:01:54.810 --> 00:02:00.810
