document I have here is Einstein's final

00:02:00.810 --> 00:02:06.240
grades from his year at the Aargau
school. Herr Albert Einstein from Ulm,

00:02:06.240 --> 00:02:12.080
which is the town in Germany that he was
from, born on the 14th of March

00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:19.410
1879, that's Pi Day the 14th of March,
attended the Canton school in Aargau.

