00:04:41.190 --> 00:04:46.260
Now Weber is a teacher of Einsteins worth
mentioning because he made quite an

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:50.880
impact on Einstein during his time there.
After Einstein initially failed the

00:04:50.880 --> 00:04:56.220
entrance exam when he was only 16,
it was Weber who invited Einstein to sit

00:04:56.220 --> 00:04:59.940
in on his lectures while he was
