00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:05.100
But during Einstein's time as a student
with him Weber seems to have turned on

00:05:05.100 --> 00:05:10.080
Einstein and they ended with a very poor
relationship. Einstein thought that

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:14.520
Weber's physics lectures were actually a
